{
  "name": "Promax — Instagram (Nosotros)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Promax — Instagram automático\nMuestra tus últimos 15 reels en la web (sección *Nosotros*) y se actualiza solo.\n\n### Pasos (una sola vez)\n1. **Import** este workflow en n8n.\n2. Abre el nodo **🔑 Ajustes (EDITA AQUÍ)** y pega tu **token de Instagram** en `ig_token`.\n3. Activa el workflow (toggle arriba a la derecha).\n4. Copia la **Production URL** del nodo *Webhook* y pégala en\n   `assets/js/config.js` → `endpoints.instagramFeed`.\n\n### ¿De dónde sale el token?\nCuenta de Instagram **Profesional** (Negocio/Creador) → en\ndevelopers.facebook.com creas una app *Instagram* y generas un\n**token de larga duración** (dura 60 días).\n\nEl token se renueva con el otro workflow incluido *(refresh)* o\npegando uno nuevo. Si prefieres no usar la API, deja\n`instagramFeed` vacío y edita `assets/data/instagram.json` a mano.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "ig-node-001",
      "name": "Instrucciones",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1180,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "GET",
        "path": "promax-instagram",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "ig-node-002",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -1120,
        320
      ],
      "webhookId": "promax-instagram"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "ig_token",
              "value": "PEGA_AQUI_TU_TOKEN_DE_INSTAGRAM",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a2",
              "name": "ig_user_id",
              "value": "me",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "ig-node-003",
      "name": "🔑 Ajustes (EDITA AQUÍ)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -880,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://graph.instagram.com/{{ $json.ig_user_id }}/media",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "fields",
              "value": "id,caption,media_type,media_url,permalink,thumbnail_url,timestamp"
            },
            {
              "name": "limit",
              "value": "15"
            },
            {
              "name": "access_token",
              "value": "={{ $json.ig_token }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "ig-node-004",
      "name": "Instagram API",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -640,
        320
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Toma la respuesta de la API de Instagram y la deja lista para la web.\nconst r = $input.item.json;\nconst data = (r && r.data) || [];\nconst out = data.slice(0, 15).map(function (m) {\n  return {\n    permalink: m.permalink || 'https://www.instagram.com/promaxautobroker/',\n    thumbnail: m.thumbnail_url || m.media_url || '',\n    type: m.media_type || 'IMAGE',\n    caption: m.caption || ''\n  };\n});\nreturn { json: { data: out } };"
      },
      "id": "ig-node-005",
      "name": "Format",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -400,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseHeaders": {
            "entries": [
              {
                "name": "Access-Control-Allow-Origin",
                "value": "*"
              },
              {
                "name": "Cache-Control",
                "value": "public, max-age=900"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "ig-node-006",
      "name": "Respond JSON",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -160,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### (Opcional) Renovar token solo\nEste lado renueva el token de Instagram automáticamente\ncada 50 días para que nunca se venza.\nSi lo usas, pega el token también aquí abajo.",
        "height": 230,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "ig-node-007",
      "name": "Nota Refresh",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1180,
        640
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 50
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "ig-node-008",
      "name": "Cada 50 días",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -1120,
        820
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b1",
              "name": "ig_token",
              "value": "PEGA_AQUI_TU_TOKEN_DE_INSTAGRAM",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "ig-node-009",
      "name": "Token actual",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -880,
        820
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://graph.instagram.com/refresh_access_token",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "grant_type",
              "value": "ig_refresh_token"
            },
            {
              "name": "access_token",
              "value": "={{ $json.ig_token }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "ig-node-010",
      "name": "Renovar token",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -640,
        820
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    }
  ],
